      "writtenOn": "2023-11-13T23:31:52Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I generally like that suggestion. More intentional than simply allowing the wrapping of the BETex to fail. For my knowledge, what does Android do with non-renderable AHwBuf-BackendTextures anyhow? (Also pinged Nolan asking that)\n\nThat should help me answer some small followup considerations I have (like whether or not we can/want to add VkImage transfer src/dst usage flags).",
