      "writtenOn": "2023-11-13T17:50:30Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027m pretty sure we actually want this to be foreign. In Ganesh we used external at the time because of a qcomm bug not supporting it early on. But at this point all drivers should support foreign as its part of Android requirements.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 476,
